usage: okto-nexus connect [-h] [--id HARNESS_ID] [--profile PROFILE]
                          [--new-connection]
                          [--operator-profile OPERATOR_PROFILE]
                          [--remote-draft REMOTE_DRAFT]
                          [--setup-receipt-output SETUP_RECEIPT_OUTPUT]
                          [--review-current] [--start-at-login |
                          --no-start-at-login] [--agent AGENT |
                          --new-agent NEW_AGENT] [--name NAME]
                          [--client CLIENT] [--project PROJECT]
                          [--workspace-id WORKSPACE_ID]
                          [--binding-id BINDING_ID]
                          [--candidate-ref CANDIDATE_REF]
                          [--provider-home PROVIDER_HOME] [--plan]
                          [--approve APPROVE] [--json] [--no-chat]
                          [--timeout TIMEOUT]
                          [harness] [project_name]

Review and connect this project using the canonical managed setup.

positional arguments:
  harness               public harness token (codex, claude, pi)
  project_name          logical project name; never a directory path

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --id HARNESS_ID       ID do Harness (Harness ID) in this project
  --profile PROFILE     technical saved local profile; retained for scripts
                        and recovery
  --new-connection      explicitly add another connection
  --operator-profile OPERATOR_PROFILE
                        saved human operator profile on a remote Server
  --remote-draft REMOTE_DRAFT
                        remote host draft exported by Connector
  --setup-receipt-output SETUP_RECEIPT_OUTPUT
                        export the public remote handoff
  --review-current
  --start-at-login
  --no-start-at-login
  --agent AGENT         existing canonical agent ID
  --new-agent NEW_AGENT
                        proposed unused canonical identity ID
  --name NAME           display name of the new identity
  --client CLIENT       legacy harness selector; tokens resolve after parsing
  --project PROJECT     physical directory, independently of project name
  --workspace-id WORKSPACE_ID
  --binding-id BINDING_ID
  --candidate-ref CANDIDATE_REF
  --provider-home PROVIDER_HOME
  --plan                review without service, Git, probes or model turns
  --approve APPROVE     apply the exact displayed review revision
  --json
  --no-chat
  --timeout TIMEOUT
